<title>AUSTRIA: KUWAIT HOPES FOR OIL PRICE IMPROVEMENT SOON.</title>
<headline>KUWAIT HOPES FOR OIL PRICE IMPROVEMENT SOON.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwaiti oil minister Isa al-Mazeedi said on Tuesday that the current oil price weakness was seasonal and he hopes for an improvement soon.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope this is going to change very soon for the better,&quot; he told reporters on arrival for this week's OPEC conference.</p>
<p>North Sea Brent Blend crude is currently around $18 per barrel, down from close to $25 earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
